        "text_block_mQ7YAA": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p><strong>Did you know there's a clinically-proven way to reverse visible signs of aging in just 10 minutes a day, without needles, downtime, or dermatologist visits?</strong></p><p>I'm 47, and for years I watched my reflection betray me. Deep lines around my eyes. Sagging along my jawline. Age spots that makeup couldn't hide. Every morning felt like a reminder that I was losing the battle against time.</p><p>The worst part? I'd already tried everything. I've spent over $12,000 in the past three years alone. Professional microneedling at $400 per session. Prescription retinoids that burned my skin. $200 serums. Monthly hydrafacials. LED treatments at my dermatologist's office for $150 each.</p><p>They helped... temporarily. My skin would look better for a few days, then right back to square one. I was trapped in an expensive cycle with no end in sight.</p><p>My dermatologist kept pushing me toward Botox or fillers. But the thought of injecting toxins into my face every few months terrified me. Plus, those costs never end.</p><p>I was ready to accept that youthful, glowing skin was behind me.</p><p><strong>Until my sister's wedding changed everything.</strong></p><p>At the reception, I barely recognized her maid of honor—my childhood friend Rachel. We're the same age, but her skin was absolutely glowing. No visible pores. Smooth texture. That natural radiance I thought was gone forever.</p><p>She showed me a before photo from just 4 months earlier. I couldn't believe it was the same person. The transformation was dramatic—and she'd done it all at home with an LED light therapy mask she used for just 10 minutes a day.</p><p>For less than two visits to my dermatologist, I could own one forever. Three days later, mine arrived.</p>",
            "text_font_size": 16,
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "line_height": 1.6,
            "highlight_words": "",
            "highlight_background_color": "#e0e0e0",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000",
            "highlight_padding": 2,
            "highlight_border_radius": 3,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 1
          }
