            "text_content": "<p>Introducing <strong>Luvea</strong>, a breakthrough LED face mask that brings professional-grade light therapy into your home.</p><p>This isn't some gimmicky beauty gadget. The technology behind LED light therapy was originally developed by NASA for wound healing in space. Dermatologists have been using it in their offices for years, charging $150-300 per session.</p><p>Luvea uses seven different wavelengths of light, each targeting specific skin concerns:</p>",
