        "text_block_7A7xWi": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p>Unlike drugstore LED masks that use weak, ineffective lights, Luvea delivers medical-grade intensity without any heat, pain, or side effects. And it works on all skin types and tones—something many laser treatments can't claim.</p><p><strong>How Does It Work?</strong></p><p>Your skin cells have photoreceptors—they literally absorb light energy just like plants do. When exposed to specific wavelengths of LED light, it triggers a cascade of beneficial cellular responses. Red light penetrates 8-10mm deep, stimulating fibroblasts to produce more collagen and elastin. Blue light destroys P. acnes bacteria. Near-infrared light boosts circulation, delivering more oxygen and nutrients to skin cells.</p><p>The result? Skin that looks and acts younger at a cellular level. Most users start seeing visible improvements within 2-3 weeks. By week 8-12, the results are dramatic—reduced wrinkles, smaller pores, more even tone, and that healthy glow.</p>",
            "text_font_size": 16,
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "line_height": 1.6,
            "highlight_words": "",
            "highlight_background_color": "#e0e0e0",
