        "text_block_M4bJj3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p>This is the best part—it's ridiculously easy. No complicated routines. No painful procedures.</p><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your face like you normally would</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Put on the mask, select your treatment mode (there are 7 preset combinations), and relax</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> After 10 minutes, the mask automatically shuts off. Remove it, apply your serum or moisturizer, and you're done</p><p>That's it. Ten minutes. Once a day. You can do it while you answer emails, watch TV, or meditate. The mask is completely hands-free with an adjustable strap, so you can move around while using it. And unlike some LED devices that feel hot or uncomfortable, this one stays cool and gentle on your skin.</p>",
            "text_font_size": 16,
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "line_height": 1.6,
            "highlight_words": "10 minutes,Once a day",
            "highlight_background_color": "#f5f5f5",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000",
            "highlight_padding": 2,
            "highlight_border_radius": 3,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 28
          }
        },
        "article_heading_cnAx4C": {
          "type": "article_heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<p><strong>My Own 90-Day Transformation</strong></p>",
            "highlight_text": "",
            "heading_font_size": 36,
            "heading_line_height": 1.2,
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text_alignment": "left",
