        "text_block_g8RkKJ": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p>Here's the uncomfortable truth: the medical aesthetics industry is worth $60 billion annually. Dermatologists make substantial income from in-office LED treatments, Botox, fillers, and laser procedures.</p><p>If everyone knew they could achieve professional results at home for a one-time cost of $249, that's a lot of recurring revenue at risk.</p><p>Luvea uses the exact same technology and similar power output as the professional machines. The main difference? You own it. You use it in your bathroom. And you never have to book another expensive appointment.</p><p>That's why you won't find this in Sephora or Ulta. We sell directly to consumers to keep costs down and put the power literally in your hands.</p>",
            "text_font_size": 16,
            "text_color": "#000000",
