        "text_block_fRJxYV": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p><strong>Expensive Creams & Serums:</strong> At best, they work on the surface. Most active ingredients can't penetrate deep enough to stimulate real collagen production.</p><p><strong>In-Office Treatments:</strong> They work! But you're paying $150-300 per session, twice weekly. That's $1,200-2,400 per month. Most people can't sustain that.</p><p><strong>Botox & Fillers:</strong> Temporary paralysis or artificial volume. You'll need repeat treatments every 3-6 months, forever. Plus, they don't actually improve skin health.</p><p><strong>Cheap LED Devices:</strong> Most don't have enough power output or the right wavelengths to create real change. They're basically expensive night lights.</p>",
            "text_font_size": 16,
