        "text_block_7fYAVT": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p>Professional LED light therapy sessions cost $150-300 per visit. Dermatologists recommend at least 2 sessions per week for 12 weeks to see optimal results. That's $3,600-7,200 for three months of treatment.</p><p>Luvea costs $249. Use it every day for the rest of your life.</p><p>For the next 48 hours, we're offering Luvea at <strong>40% OFF the regular price</strong>. That brings your cost to just <strong>$149</strong>—less than the cost of a single professional LED session.</p>",
            "text_font_size": 16,
