        "text_block_rV89zg": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p>If you use this for just 10 minutes a day for one year (365 days), that's <strong>41¢ per treatment</strong>.</p><p>Compare that to professional LED sessions ($150-300), Botox ($400-600), prescription retinoids ($80-200), or monthly facials ($150-250).</p><p>After just one month of daily use, your cost per treatment drops to mere pennies. This isn't just more effective than expensive creams and sporadic treatments—it's also the most economical way to maintain young, healthy skin long-term.</p>",
