        "text_block_XwJUte": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p>Use Luvea for a full 90 days. If you don't see visible improvement in your skin—fewer wrinkles, clearer complexion, better texture, more radiance—return it for a complete refund.</p><p>No questions asked. No restocking fees. No hassle.</p><p>We can make this guarantee because we know the technology works. Thousands of women (and men) have transformed their skin with this device. The science is solid. The results are real.</p><p>But we also know you've been burned by products that promised miracles before. So we're putting our money where our mouth is.</p><p>Either this becomes your favorite skincare tool and you wonder how you ever lived without it, or you get every penny back. That's what a true risk-free guarantee looks like.</p>",
