          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text_content": "<p>Click the button below to secure your Luvea mask at 40% OFF before this offer ends.</p><p>You'll be taken to our secure checkout page where you can choose your mask color (rose gold, pearl white, or matte black) and see your 40% discount automatically applied.</p><p>Your order will ship within 24 hours with tracking information sent via email.</p><p><strong>Many customers order two</strong>—one for themselves and one as a gift. With Mother's Day, birthdays, and holidays coming up, this makes an incredible present for any woman who cares about her skin.</p><p>But here's the important part: <strong>this 40% discount expires in 48 hours</strong>, and our current inventory is selling faster than expected. We manufacture these in limited batches to ensure quality control, and when this batch sells out, the next one won't arrive for 6-8 weeks. The discount definitely won't be available then.</p><p><strong>STOCK ALERT:</strong> As of this morning, we have fewer than 200 units remaining in this production run. At our current sales velocity, we expect to sell out within the next 24-36 hours.</p><p>Don't let another month go by watching your skin age when you could be actively reversing the damage. Click below to claim your Luvea mask while this offer lasts.</p>",
